{
  "slug": "clever-comebacks",
  "name": "Clever Comebacks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Paste a mean message, pick a tier (soft, medium, heavy, trainwreck), get one clever sentence back. The reply you would have thought of three hours later, now while it still matters. The skill enforces a single-sentence constraint, reframes instead of escalating, and ends on the strongest word. Hard limits at every tier including trainwreck: no slurs, no threats of physical or sexual violence, no targeting the speaker's family or kids, no doxxing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `clever-comebacks` (Generate a single-sentence clever comeback to a mean message at a chosen intensity tier (soft, medium, heavy, trainwreck)).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install clever-comebacks@claude-community` from `avectats7/clever-comebacks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
